# Embedded capsule Git stores and candidate snapshots are binary. Upstream
# .gitattributes files inside baselines must never normalize them.
# Nested attribute files take precedence over this one, so a fresh clone must
# also copy these two lines into .git/info/attributes BEFORE checkout
# (see README.md, "Cloning").
capsules/**/.gitdir/** -text -diff
capsules/**/.candidate-*/** -text -diff

# Vendored upstream source, toolchains, wheels and image sources. They are the
# subjects of the tasks, not code written here, so keep them out of GitHub's
# language statistics.
